<item><title>Bujumbura women who beg ask government for start-up capital</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/bujumbura-women-who-beg-ask-government-for-start-up-capital-33a29b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/bujumbura-women-who-beg-ask-government-for-start-up-capital-33a29b/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Charlotte Nijimbere and other women say small grants and support to start businesses would help them leave the streets and regain independence.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:54:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Rebel FRN retakes Rurambo and Munanira in eastern Congo</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/rebel-frn-retakes-rurambo-and-munanira-in-eastern-congo-ad4ad6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/rebel-frn-retakes-rurambo-and-munanira-in-eastern-congo-ad4ad6/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Local sources say the movement also took Muhungu hill and Kahiya, as civilians fled the fighting near Lubarika.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:23:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burundi governance group urges Ndayishimiye to change course before 2027 vote</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-governance-group-urges-ndayishimiye-to-change-15bfde/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-governance-group-urges-ndayishimiye-to-change-15bfde/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>The Parole et Actions pour le Réveil des Consciences et l&apos;Évolution des Mentalités (PARCEM), a local governance group, says the next president must address inflation, shortages.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:47:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-governance-group-urges-ndayishimiye-to-change-15bfde/share.jpg" length="43599" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-governance-group-urges-ndayishimiye-to-change-15bfde/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
